window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>With aliens this hot, maybe being abducted isn’t so bad!</b><br> <b>3 books. Hours of steamy alien romance and sci-fi adventure.</b><br> <br> Meet silver fox Varden, the captain of the space station who falls hard for a human who thinks he’s a hologram. Then there’s first officer Kos whose tribute bride is stolen by galactic pirates. And Inferno Force captain Brok is fully prepared to rescue a kidnapped human. He just didn’t know he’d need to do it without his clothes!<br> <br> Sparks will fly as the brave and brawny Drexian warriors fight to survive on alien worlds, defeat space pirates, stage rescues in exotic space zoos, and infiltrate alien royalty.<br> <br> Tribute Brides of the Drexian Warriors Collection Books 8-10 contains<i> three full-length novels. If you like enemies-to-lovers romance, star-crossed lovers, galactic action-adventure, and steamy abduction to seduction romance with a guaranteed HEA after and no cheating, you’ll love this three-book collection.</i></p>"; 
